    {
      "id": "wL2lZFpJK_bxPJTvqaH3a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1829.9538042347995,
      "y": 137.92421329086756,
      "width": 761.2594604492188,
      "height": 275,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ac",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 568862145,
      "version": 628,
      "versionNonce": 1664133089,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789578751106,
      "created": 1789578090942,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Create Linode Server (or any VPS provider)\n    -> This will give you a public IP address to login to the server.\n- Install Login and System Update\n- Create Non-Root User\n- Set Up SSH Key Authentication (Do this BEFORE disabling password auth!)\n- Harden SSH Configuration\n- Set Timezone\n- Configuration Hostname\n- Set Up Firewall (UFW)\n- Set Up Fail2Ban (Brute Force Protection)\n- Enable Automatic Security Updates",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Create Linode Server (or any VPS provider)\n    -> This will give you a public IP address to login to the server.\n- Install Login and System Update\n- Create Non-Root User\n- Set Up SSH Key Authentication (Do this BEFORE disabling password auth!)\n- Harden SSH Configuration\n- Set Timezone\n- Configuration Hostname\n- Set Up Firewall (UFW)\n- Set Up Fail2Ban (Brute Force Protection)\n- Enable Automatic Security Updates",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
